      "kind": "official-guide",
      "anchors": [
        "Manage call audio endpoints",
        "Remote Surface support",
        "Foreground support"
      ],
      "observations": "Core-Telecom註冊自管通話並接收遠端操作回呼；由可用端點請求路由，再觀察實際端點。通話媒體採voice-call stream。不可同時使用AudioManager的SCO/communication-device路由。新增通話不等於已啟用音訊。通知及遠端回呼都有5秒要求。"
    },
    {
      "id": "connectionservice",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/ConnectionService",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "anchors": [
        "Self-Managed Connection Services",
        "Incoming Calls"
      ],
      "observations": "自管服務不需取代預設撥號程式；須註冊自管PhoneAccount。Bluetooth車機／耳機可看到及控制自管通話。新增App自己的來電，由App自己的Connection回報狀態，不是呼叫電信撥號API。緊急通話／並行通話等條件可能拒絕新增。"
    },
    {
      "id": "owncalls-permission",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#MANAGE_OWN_CALLS",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "observations": "MANAGE_OWN_CALLS於API26加入，保護層級normal；不等同簽章電話控制權限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "connection-routes",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/Connection#requestCallEndpointChange(android.telecom.CallEndpoint,java.util.concurrent.Executor,android.os.OutcomeReceiver)",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "observations": "requestBluetoothAudio於API28加入、API34棄用；可因堆疊限制改到其他Bluetooth裝置。API34的requestCallEndpointChange只能使用系統提供的端點，成功時須觀察實际端點變更。"
    },
    {
      "id": "phonecall-fgs",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/develop/background-work/services/fgs/service-types#phone-call",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-guide",
      "observations": "phoneCall前景服務須宣告对应型別／權限；先決條件為MANAGE_OWN_CALLS或預設dialer其一。從可見使用者操作啟動，保留Android版本相關前景服務限制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "media-player",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/MediaPlayer#setAudioAttributes(android.media.AudioAttributes)",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "observations": "播放音訊屬性须在prepare前設定；此API存在不保證指定Garmin端點已收到音訊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-attributes",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioAttributes.Builder#setLegacyStreamType(int)",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "observations": "公開Builder能從voice-call stream取得屬性，API21起提供；不要混設其他usage/content而覆蓋属性。一般建議明確usage/content。"
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-manager",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioManager#startBluetoothSco()",
      "retrieved_date_utc": "2026-10-07",
      "kind": "official-api-reference",
      "observations": "舊SCO文件列通話stream、mono、8或16kHz輸出限制；不可推成此Pixel／Garmin已協商的實際codec。AudioManager另有公開communication-device方法，但本提案採Telecom端點API，不同時使用。"
    },
